# AI Contract — Rules of Engagement

> **Why this file exists:** the hard rules an agent must obey are spread across
> `CLAUDE.md`, `apps/*/CLAUDE.md`, `.ai-agent.yaml`, and `docs/**`. This is the single
> **index** of those rules. It **does not create or copy rules** — each points to its
> owning source. If this index disagrees with a source, the **source wins**; if a source
> disagrees with the code, the **code wins** — flag the mismatch.

## Owning sources (authority order — top wins)

1. **Code** — the running system.
2. [`/CLAUDE.md`](../../CLAUDE.md) — workspace rules & anti-goals.
3. `apps/*/CLAUDE.md` — per-app rules (override root **within their app**).
4. [`/.ai-agent.yaml`](../../.ai-agent.yaml) — machine guardrails (protected paths, commands).
5. `docs/**` — standards, contracts, decisions.

